# File-backed openOODA vendor

This tree is the file-backed vendor. HTTPS serves the same files at `https://registry.openooda.org`. `index.minisig` is minisign of `index`. `index.sig` is leftover HMAC for local `--vendor`.

Each directory is a package name with `manifest` (key=value) and a payload `.oo` file.
`index` plus `index.sig` is the signed catalog. `yank` and `advisory` are local policy files.
The stock store is this origin. The human page searches `/catalog`.
`ooda add hello` fetches the same file.

Usage from `ooda/`:

    ./bin/ooda add hello
    ./bin/ooda search hello
    ./bin/ooda registry
    ./bin/ooda pkg
